description	"Koth Melan

^2Weaponry:
- Bothan Blade

^6Inventory:
- Cloaking Device (2)

^8Attributes:
- Slicing Skills [Fast Hacking]
- Stamina (3)

^3Abilities:
- 3 Poison Darts ^3[CS1 Melee]
- 6 Tracking Darts ^3[CS2 Melee]
- Sprint ^3[CS3]

Since the Galactic Empire had executed his father in 17 BBY for supposed treason, Melan was sympathetic to the Alliance to Restore the Republic, and sought to help them in order to regain his honour."